data: {"id": "f5807d384e074ce5-thinking-parallel_evidence-1496", "run_id": "f5807d384e074ce5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 第一轮采集事实\n\n**1. Prometheus Metrics (execute_pod_promql)**\n- `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, reason = \"ContainerCreating\" (direct evidence for `app` container)\n- `kube_pod_status_phase` = 1 for \"Pending\", 0 for Running/Succeeded/Unknown/Failed (kube-state-metrics perspective)\n- `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` = 0\n- **结论**: Metrics 确认 Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating，未重启。\n\n**2. Logging (query_pod_logs)**\n- coverage = \"empty\"，ES/Filebeat 无匹配记录。\n- **结论**: 容器未启动，无应用日志，符合预期", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788781958941, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

